<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#AudioSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An audio signal selected or derived for triggered or otherwise bounded playback as part of a digital or virtual musical instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#AudioSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An audio sample is the identified playback signal, not merely a region of a larger signal and not automatically a file or bitstream. Use extractedFromRegion for source selection and media terms for byte-level realizations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#AudioSignal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
