<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#LoopPointSet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Class membership does not state whether the grouping is tentative or accepted. A governing workflow or application profile must record that lifecycle decision."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#ReleaseRegion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
