<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#ReleaseRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A signal region selected for playback or analysis of the release phase following cessation of excitation or control."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#SampleExtractionRegion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
