<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#appliesToSignal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "SignalRegion and LoopPointSet are the subjects constrained by the 0.1.0 exchange profile. No global domain is asserted because additional source-scoped record classes may reuse the property without receiving an incorrect type inference."@en .
