<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#tuningSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use a stable IRI for a documented tuning system; retain a source label on that identified resource rather than embedding an opaque tuning-system string in the map."@en .
