<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#usesPlaybackParameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a virtual instrument, version, control mapping, or package to sampled-playback parameters it uses."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#usesPlaybackParameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The open subject position avoids a dependency from the audio module to every possible application class. Application profiles must constrain which resources may use playback parameters."@en .
